# use — fail
#
# USE attempted at the ruin's old anvil and missed on the dice: FAILURE, and the crafting menu does not
# open. The failure costs one of USE's penalties (a scrape, the hour, or focus) like any failed act.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm blacksmithing --grant-item hammer,iron_bar --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Ruin" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Old Anvil"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy fail-dice
goal use
means blacksmithing
advance 12 180

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose ripelore
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click action 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

expect FAILURE
expect-verb use
expect-no-outcome crafting_opened
click button
wait 2
expect-state crafting crafting menu=closed
quit
